### Tenant Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Slow Test"
}

### Endpoint Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://httpbin.org/delay/10",
  "eventTypes": ["slow.test"]
}

### Endpoint Get
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/endpoints

### THROW 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/endpoints
