{
  "url": "https://acme.com/hook",
  "description": "",
  "eventTypes": []
}

### THROW 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://acme.com/hook",
  "description": "Ana webhook",
  "eventTypes": ["payment.succeeded", "order.created"]
}


### Ingest POST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/events
